Keep the transforms inside their windows and shift ranges.

- trans4m_freq_2_time_fxp.cpp: the EIGHT_SHORT_SEQUENCE overlap loops
  (both functions) prefetched the next window coefficient on their last
  iteration, one Int32 past the Short_Window tables (global overflow);
  the last iteration no longer reads it.
- trans4m_time_2_freq_fxp.cpp: long_term_prediction() returns a Q format
  of 0 for a prediction that already fits 16 bits, and the window then
  shifted by -1 (UBSan); it is treated as 1 (no shift).

Regression inputs:
tools/aacdec-fuzz/regressions/t169-short-window-prefetch.bin and
t169-ltp-q-format.bin.

